ghostlock-s26
Copyright 2026

CVE-2026-43499 ported to the Samsung Galaxy S26 series, built on the
CyberMeowfia-s26 baseline with every mechanism rewritten for the S26 target.

## Third-party notices

| Component                                              | Upstream                    | License    |
| ------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------- | ---------- |
| Tracefs slide, walk timing oracle, stale-page handling | polygraphene/CyberMeowfia   | Apache-2.0 |
| KernelSnitch (mm_struct futex-hash leak)               | lukasmaar/kernelsnitch      | MIT        |
| per-child lock regions, UMH root, boot-claim gating    | monovibe/s26u-m3q-temp-root | Apache-2.0 |

The vendored KernelSnitch retains its MIT copyright notice in
`exploit/src/kernelsnitch/`. No other third-party subtree is imported.
